// nrl-bridge
### GET Healthcheck
GET localhost:3000/health

### POST test notifier - deals (sends a sample to every active notifier handling 'deals')
POST localhost:3000/test/deals
x-admin-secret: {{admin_secret}}

### POST test notifier - twitch-prime
POST localhost:3000/test/twitch-prime
x-admin-secret: {{admin_secret}}

// ITAD API
### GET deals order by cut desc
GET https://api.isthereanydeal.com/deals/v2?key={{itad_api_key}}&country=FR&sort=-cut

### GET Shops
GET https://api.isthereanydeal.com/service/shops/v1?country=FR